 Bengal State Legal Services Authority (WBSLSA)",jurisdiction:"West Bengal",state:"West Bengal",serviceType:"Mediation",address:"City Civil Court Building, 1st Floor, 2 & 3, Kiran Sankar Roy Road, Kolkata - 700001",phone:"033-22483892",email:"wbstatelegal@gmail.com",website:"https://wbslsa.gov.in",lastVerified:"2024-12-10",eligibility:"All persons qualified under Section 12 LSA Act 1987."},{id:"slsa-mp",name:"Madhya Pradesh State Legal Services Authority (MPSLSA)",jurisdiction:"Madhya Pradesh",state:"Madhya Pradesh",serviceType:"Free Legal Aid",address:"C-Block, Old R.T.O. Building, South Civil Lines, Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh - 482001",phone:"0761-2678352",email:"mpslsa@mp.gov.in",website:"https://mpslsa.gov.in",lastVerified:"2024-04-10",eligibility:"Income limit \u20b91.5 Lakhs per annum, SC/ST, women, custodial inmates."},{id:"slsa-tn",name:"Tamil Nadu State Legal Services Authority (TNSLSA)",jurisdiction:"Tamil Nadu",state:"Tamil Nadu",serviceType:"Women's Helpline",address:"North Fort Road, High Court Campus, Chennai, Tamil Nadu - 600104",phone:"044-25342834",email:"tnslsa@gmail.com",website:"https://tnslsa.tn.gov.in",lastVerified:"2025-01-15",eligibility:"Income under \u20b93 Lakhs, women, children, workers in unorganized sector."},{id:"slsa-rj",name:"Rajasthan State Legal Services Authority (RSLSA)",jurisdiction:"Rajasthan",state:"Rajasthan",serviceType:"Lok Adalat",address:"Rajasthan High Court Campus, Jaipur, Rajasthan - 302005",phone:"0141-2227481",email:"rslsajpr@gmail.com",website:"https://rlsa.gov.in",lastVerified:"2024-10-01",eligibility:"Eligible citizens under Rajasthan Legal Services Rules."},{id:"slsa-ka",name:"Karnataka State Legal Services Authority (KSLSA)",jurisdiction:"Karnataka",state:"Karnataka",serviceType:"Mediation",address:"Nyaya Degula, 1st Floor, H. Siddaiah Road, Bengaluru, Karnataka - 560027",phone:"080-22111714",email:"kslsa.kar@nic.in",website:"https://kslsa.kar.nic.in",lastVerified:"2025-01-20",eligibility:"Income limit \u20b93 Lakhs, custody inmates, disabled individuals."},{id:"slsa-gj",name:"Gujarat State Legal Services Authority (GSLSA)",jurisdiction:"Gujarat",state:"Gujarat",serviceType:"Free Legal Aid",address:"Gujarat High Court Complex, Sola, Ahmedabad, Gujarat - 380060",phone:"079-27664966",email:"gslsa-ahd@nic.in",website:"https://gslsa.gujarat.gov.in",lastVerified:"2024-06-12",eligibility:"Income limit \u20b93 Lakhs, factory workers, women & minors."},{id:"slsa-ap",name:"Andhra Pradesh State Legal Services Authority (APSLSA)",jurisdiction:"Andhra Pradesh",state:"Andhra Pradesh",serviceType:"Free Legal Aid",address:"Ground Floor, High Court Buildings, Nelapadu, Amaravati, Andhra Pradesh - 522237",phone:"0863-2374343",email:"apslsa@nic.in",website:"https://apslsa.ap.nic.in",lastVerified:"2024-11-05",eligibility:"Indigent litigants, marginalized communities across Andhra Pradesh."},{id:"dlsa-delhi-central",name:"District Legal Services Authority (Central Delhi)",jurisdiction:"Central Delhi",state:"National",serviceType:"Free Legal Aid",address:"Room No. 287, Tis Hazari Courts Complex, Delhi - 110054",phone:"011-23968052",email:"central-dlsa@nic.in",website:"https://dslsa.org",lastVerified:"2025-01-08",eligibility:"Walk-in legal aid clinic open Monday to Saturday."},{id:"dlsa-mumbai",name:"District Legal Services Authority (Mumbai City)",jurisdiction:"Mumbai City",state:"Maharashtra",serviceType:"Free Legal Aid",address:"City Civil and Sessions Court, Old Building, Fort, Mumbai - 400032",phone:"022-22676066",email:"dlsa.mumbaicity@gmail.com",website:"https://legalservices.maharashtra.gov.in",lastVerified:"2025-01-12",eligibility:"Free advocate assignment for pending litigation."},{id:"dlsa-pune",name:"District Legal Services Authority (Pune)",jurisdiction:"Pune District",state:"Maharashtra",serviceType:"Mediation",address:"District Court Compound, Shivajinagar, Pune, Maharashtra - 411005",phone:"020-25534766",email:"dlsapune@gmail.com",website:"https://districts.ecourts.gov.in/pune",la